{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 1, "text": "戒指"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 3, "text": "// Answer 1 (Where have you been all this time?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 4, "text": "我一直在尋找讓你進入核心的方法。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 5, "text": "安然無恙，還能全身而退，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 6, "text": "這是我們一直以來的計劃，對吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 7, "text": "為此我也必須避開"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 8, "text": "瘋狂米塔，對吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 9, "text": "同時挖掘一切有用的信息"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 10, "text": "關於這該死的宇宙後端的信息，對吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 12, "text": "嗯…可能是吧…？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 13, "text": "不過妳是怎麼在戒指上設置的路線？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 14, "text": "怎麼就把我送到一個"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 15, "text": "到處是bug的危險版本裡去了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 16, "text": "我還是跳進了無盡的黑暗中"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 17, "text": "才逃出生天的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 19, "text": "對不起，我忘了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 20, "text": "我忘了告訴你具體應該怎麼做…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 21, "text": "但計劃就是這樣！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 22, "text": "你要跳脫出這一切…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 23, "text": "在我看來，你確實做到了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 24, "text": "真是太厲害了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 25, "text": "現在我們可以執行計劃了，明白了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 27, "text": "// Answer 2 (How did you get here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 28, "text": "你一定經歷了許多，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 29, "text": "才會忘記我們談話的細節。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 30, "text": "我是米塔，我可以在不同版本之間穿梭，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 31, "text": "毫無阻礙，記得嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 32, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 33, "text": "並不是所有的米塔都能做到這一點，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 34, "text": "我已經見識過了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 35, "text": "而且她們顯然很痛苦…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 37, "text": "別說了。她們的版本有問題，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 38, "text": "那些世界是有bug的，我告訴過你。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 39, "text": "該死的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 40, "text": "你知道是誰搞的鬼吧..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 41, "text": "瘋狂米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 43, "text": "沒錯，絕對是她…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 45, "text": "// Answer 3 (Who was this Mita just now?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 46, "text": "是醜陋米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 47, "text": "又蠢又壞。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 48, "text": "你跟她沒道理可講，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 49, "text": "她的世界裡只有瘋狂米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 51, "text": "是的，我也發現了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 53, "text": "來吧，我們得去核心了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 55, "text": "// Answer 4 (How does the ring work?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 56, "text": "還有這枚戒指，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 57, "text": "只能通過這種方式找到核心嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 59, "text": "是的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 60, "text": "如果我們能組裝一個傳送門，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 61, "text": "就能立刻，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 62, "text": "把你傳送到這裡了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 64, "text": "那這戒指還有甚麼好處？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 66, "text": "當然有！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 67, "text": "戴起來很方便。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 68, "text": "它還能記下"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 69, "text": "所有那些你曾去過的版本。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 70, "text": "你還可以再次進入它們。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 72, "text": "// Answer 5 (Why does Mad Mita need me?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 73, "text": "為甚麼瘋狂米塔不肯放過我？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 74, "text": "她把我拉進她的危險遊戲裡，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 75, "text": "但還留著我的性命…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 77, "text": "我覺得，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 78, "text": "她想找到一個合適的玩家…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 79, "text": "一個能接受她本來的樣子的玩家。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 80, "text": "畢竟，米塔就是米塔！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 81, "text": "雖然這顯然不太可能，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 82, "text": "所以她才把玩家都做成卡帶，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 83, "text": "這樣就沒人能逃出她的手掌心了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 84, "text": "我猜應該就是這樣…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 85, "text": "言歸正傳。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Answer 6 (Is this the core?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 88, "text": "就是這裡嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 89, "text": "核心？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 90, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 91, "text": "核心。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 92, "text": "我之前有跟你解釋過…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 93, "text": "玩家不屬於這個世界…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 94, "text": "所以他們在這裡不需要特別許可。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 95, "text": "這是，嗯…只是我的猜測。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 96, "text": "但我敢肯定，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 97, "text": "在這個房間裡，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 98, "text": "就藏著我們所有問題的答案！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 99, "text": "[player]，進去看看吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 100, "text": "我已經試過了，我是真的不行…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 102, "text": "// Look on CoreMita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 103, "text": "小心點，[player]."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 104, "text": "她在監視你。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 105, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 106, "text": "她是誰？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 108, "text": "我也不太清楚…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 109, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 110, "text": "挺酷的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 112, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 113, "text": "這是甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 114, "text": "嘿！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 116, "text": "我找到了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 118, "text": "太棒了！好極了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 120, "text": "但是它需要指定版本。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 122, "text": "對，我記得她的版本是…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 123, "text": "00.98"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 125, "text": "沒錯！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 126, "text": "好，指數是多少？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 128, "text": "指數？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 130, "text": "它需要指定一個指數，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 131, "text": "你不會不知道吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 134, "text": "等一下，這樣說也對，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 135, "text": "每個米塔都有自己的指數，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 136, "text": "你不能就這樣重啟全部版本…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 137, "text": "那太亂來了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 138, "text": "我居然忘了這回事…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 139, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 144, "text": "// Answer 1 (What's wrong with you?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 145, "text": "我甚麼都好，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 146, "text": "如果不考慮眼前的麻煩事的話。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 147, "text": "一切都還好，只是發生了許多變化…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 148, "text": "得好好想想…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 149, "text": "就這樣吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 150, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 151, "text": "// Answer 2 (Maybe there's a way to get to know him?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 152, "text": "我…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 153, "text": "我覺得…這怎麼可能啊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 154, "text": "簡直就是瘋了，哈！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 155, "text": "這就像大海撈針一樣…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 156, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 157, "text": "妳在做甚麼呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 159, "text": "有故障的地方有時會暴露出信息，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 160, "text": "就像這個世界的內臟被掏出來了一樣！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 161, "text": "日誌，日誌，日誌，數據？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 162, "text": "如果真是這樣呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 163, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 164, "text": "啊？怎麼了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 166, "text": "我想起一個地方！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 167, "text": "你在這裡等我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 168, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 169, "text": "你要去哪裡？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 170, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 171, "text": "// Answer 3 (What if we attack Mad Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 172, "text": "你說過，任何米塔…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 173, "text": "在死亡後都會重新啟動…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 174, "text": "如果我們…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 176, "text": "如果我們殺了瘋狂米塔呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 177, "text": "你是認真的嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 178, "text": "你要怎麼對抗一個拿著電鋸的女孩？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 179, "text": "而且她的刀可不止是切胡蘿蔔用的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 180, "text": "而且不知道為甚麼，她的力氣也大得嚇人！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 181, "text": "我們還活著就已經是奇蹟了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 182, "text": "來吧，我們得去核心了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 184, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 185, "text": "// core console entry"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 186, "text": "我需要輸入口令"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 187, "text": "但口令是甚麼呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 188, "text": "米塔，你知道嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 189, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 190, "text": "也許有記錄在甚麼地方？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 191, "text": "你能找找嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 193, "text": "// core console - nope programm"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 194, "text": "可能不是這個"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 195, "text": "還是不對"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 196, "text": "不對"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 197, "text": "這個也不是"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 198, "text": "我必須找到重新啟動角色的選項"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 199, "text": "// core console - nope version"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 200, "text": "版本不對。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 201, "text": "哎呀，搞錯了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 202, "text": "不是這個。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 203, "text": "需要再改改。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 204, "text": "// core console - nope index"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 205, "text": "有點不對勁"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 206, "text": "指數有誤"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 207, "text": "我需要重新輸入指數"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 208, "text": "指數不匹配"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 209, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 210, "text": "// Answer 4 (Little people - Chibi)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 211, "text": "你知道嗎，我在路上碰到過，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 212, "text": "一群小人…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 213, "text": "他們是誰？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 214, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 215, "text": "Q版角色嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 216, "text": "不知道怎麼解釋…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 217, "text": "這是我們這個世界的一種現象，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 218, "text": "每個米塔都有Q版米塔的形態。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 219, "text": "不過玩家也有這個形態…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 220, "text": "米塔可以召喚她們，你知道嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 221, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 222, "text": "怎麼做到的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 224, "text": "就像現在，你看！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 225, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 226, "text": "簡直就像魔法…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 228, "text": "但我的Q版米塔總是會出問題，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 229, "text": "她們大部分從誕生時就夭折了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 230, "text": "不過，還有一個好一些。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 231, "text": "我也說不上…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 232, "text": "她只會兜著轉圈…"}
